Cyrene-Plugins is a multi-license component collection. There is no single
repository-wide license grant.

The license applicable to a component is identified by the nearest LICENSE
file, package metadata, and the mapping in LICENSING.md. Third-party and
upstream-derived material retains its original license and notices.

Source without an explicit license designation is not granted an open-source
license merely because this repository is publicly visible. All rights in such
source remain reserved by their respective copyright holders.
